  "title": "International Bancshares Corporation Announces Six Percent Increase In Cash Dividend",
  "summary": "International Bancshares Corporation (NASDAQ: IBOC) announced today that on Jan. 31, 2025, IBC’s Board of Directors approved the declaration of a .70 cents per share cash dividend for shareholders of record of Common Stock, $1.00 par value, as of the close of business on Feb. 14, 2025, payable on Feb. 28, 2025. This is an increase of 6% per share from the previous cash dividend.",
